# Vault refuse leak

## Never

- Paste tokens, passwords, private keys, or unredacted production payloads
  into chat, commits, Jira/Freshservice, or screenshots.
- Write secrets into tracked repo files.
- Log full secret bodies in CI console excerpts.

## Instead

- Store in Vault; reference by path.
- Redact to last-4 or key names only when proving a write succeeded.
- If a secret was already exposed in chat, rotate via Vault and say so —
  do not repeat the value.
